{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02820","headline":"山庄休沐 · 卢照邻","name":"山庄休沐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰署乘闲日，蓬扉狎遁栖。\n龙柯疎玉井，凤叶下金堤。\n川光摇水箭，山气上云梯。\n亭幽闻唳鹤，窗晓听鸣鸡。\n玉轸临风奏，琼浆映月携。\n田家自有乐，谁肯谢青溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}